WEBVTT

NOTE SuperFinder promo · en narration

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.614
Twenty years of browsing the web. Now, your files.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:12.092
Paste a path, press enter, and you're there. Type a few letters, hit Tab, and it completes.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.667
Open a new tab. Your favourites and recently closed tabs are waiting on the start page.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:27.198
Compare two folders without a wall of windows. Split right inside a tab, in any direction, and save the layout.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:33.287
Gather files from anywhere into the shelf. Dropping them in is just a reference, nothing moves yet.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:38.022
Pin what you keep coming back to, and stop scrolling.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:46.950
Close, and come back. Tabs, panes and the shelf are exactly where you left them.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.731
Select files, and the sidebar offers the right tools. Need more? Add a plugin, or write your own.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:01:01.350
List, hierarchy, icons, gallery. Switch views, and preview with Space, without opening anything.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:08.833
SuperFinder. A browser-style file workbench for macOS. Your files stay on your Mac. Free on the Mac App Store.
